<Layout title="Privacy & image credits" description="Privacy, form behavior, image attribution, and independent concept information for the Sigura Construction redesign demo."><Hero eyebrow="The details / Independent concept" title={'Privacy &\nimage credits.'}/><article class="section article-body"><p class="article-intro">This is an independent website redesign concept. It is not the company’s official website and has not been deployed to its domain.</p><section><h2>Your inquiry</h2><p>The estimate form validates your input and prepares an email draft locally in your browser. No form data is sent to a server, stored in local storage, or submitted automatically. If you open the email draft, your email application handles it under its own privacy terms. You must send the message yourself.</p></section><section><h2>Browser storage & third parties</h2><p>A session flag remembers that the opening animation has played. It expires with the browser session. This demo has no analytics, advertising trackers, embedded maps, or external font requests. Images, fonts, and application scripts are served locally. The hosting provider may keep standard access logs; its own policies apply. Links to certification platforms and email or telephone apps leave this demo only when you choose them.</p></section><section><h2>Photography & project information</h2><p>Portfolio and before-and-after photographs are sourced from Sigura Construction’s publicly available website for this requested local concept presentation. Ownership remains with the original rights holders. Public availability is not a license; company and photographer permission must be confirmed before publishing or redistributing these assets. Source URLs are recorded in the project’s research/assets.json file.</p><p>The homepage and custom-home architectural inspiration photograph is from Unsplash and is visibly labeled as concept imagery. It does not depict a verified Sigura project. <a href="https://unsplash.com/license" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View the Unsplash license ↗</a></p></section><section><h2>Company information & reviews</h2><p>The company contact details, founding year, and license number come from the supplied brief and published company information. Project names and locations come from the published portfolio. Reviews are presented as a short attributed excerpt or clearly labeled editorial summaries. Credentials are accompanied by independent profile links; this demo does not provide live certification status.</p></section><section><h2>Typography</h2><p>Manrope and Instrument Serif are locally hosted open-source typefaces from Google Fonts, distributed under the SIL Open Font License. Font license files are included with the source.</p></section><section><h2>Contact</h2><p>For company inquiries: <a href="mailto:info@siguraconstruction.com">info@siguraconstruction.com</a>. For this demo, contact its project maintainer regarding hosting, permissions, and implementation.</p></section><p class="source-note">Last updated October 13, 2026.</p></article></Layout>
